title: 'election-provider-support: fix MaxEncodedLen undercount in generated solution
  types'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description:
    The prefix budget assumed a one-byte length prefix per vote field,
    but a field holding `MaxVoters` elements uses a multi-byte `compact.
